# Regenerate with `./scripts/gen-presets.sh`; that script's `--check` mode
# fails when this file has drifted from `src/presets/*.json`.
#
# Three examples of the preset format, one domain at each size (ADR 027). Cyrius
# `include` is textual and takes a path to source, so the documents are turned
# into source here.
#
# ⚠ The ORDER is lean → standard → large, and not the alphabetical order of the
# directory. `agnosai_builtin_presets()` returns a vec, so position is observable.
#
# Each document is whitespace-collapsed to a single logical line. JSON
# whitespace between tokens is insignificant, so the parse is unaffected.
# =======================================================================

